kind: llman.sdd.spec
name: "package-tui-engine"
purpose: "Core TUI engine APIs for packages/xylitol-tui (Container, OverlayHandle, optional image surface)."
valid_scope[2]: "packages/xylitol-tui/",tests/
requirements[5]{req_id,title,statement}:
  pte01,"container-vertical-stack","The xylitol-tui package MUST provide a Container component that holds an ordered list of child Components, renders by concatenating each child's render(width) lines in order, invalidates all children on invalidate, and does NOT automatically fan out InputEvent to children (focus routing remains the TUI / host responsibility). Container MUST expose add_child, remove_child, and clear."
  pte02,"overlay-handle","TUI::show_overlay MUST return an OverlayHandle that can hide (permanently remove), set_hidden / is_hidden (temporary), and report is_focused. hide MUST restore focus to the previous focus target or the next visible capturing overlay. The handle MUST remain usable only while the overlay entry exists (operations after hide are no-ops)."
  pte03,"overlay-handle-focus-controls","OverlayHandle MUST expose focus and unfocus operations that bring the overlay to the visual front / release focus without requiring the host to rebuild the overlay stack. Full pi-style eligible/blocked focus-restore state machine is NOT required in this change."
  pte04,"image-surface-optional","The package MUST NOT require the Image component or full terminal_image encode path for the primary agent_demo / app-shell wiring. is_image_line (and any minimal helpers the width invariant needs) MUST remain. Unused image encode/UI surface MAY be removed or feature-gated."
  pte05,"input-listener-pre-focus",TUI MUST 提供 add_input_listener / remove_input_listener；每个 InputEvent 在路由到 focused overlay 或 focused root child 之前 MUST 按注册顺序调用 listener；任一 listener 返回 Consumed MUST 阻止后续 listener 与焦点组件接收该事件。
scenarios[8]{req_id,id,given,when,then}:
  pte01,"container-concatenates-children",a Container holds Text(a) then Text(b),render(width) is called,the output lines are a then b in order
  pte01,"container-does-not-fanout-input",a Container has a child Input,Container.handle_input receives a Key event,the child Input does not receive the event unless the host/TUI focused that child directly
  pte02,"overlay-hide-removes-from-composite",an overlay is shown via show_overlay,OverlayHandle.hide is called then the frame is rendered,the overlay content is absent from the composed lines
  pte03,"overlay-focus-brings-front",two overlays are on the stack,OverlayHandle.focus is called on the lower one,that overlay is treated as the focused/front overlay for subsequent input routing policy
  pte04,"agent-demo-builds-without-image","the xylitol-tui package is built with default features","agent_demo and cargo test -p xylitol-tui run",they succeed without depending on the Image component API
  pte05,"listener-consumes-before-focus",已注册对 ctrl+c 返回 Consumed 的 listener，且 Editor 处于焦点,调用 dispatch_event(Key(ctrl+c)),Editor 不收到该事件
  pte05,"listener-yields-to-focus",listener 对普通字符返回 Continue，Editor 处于焦点,调用 dispatch_event(Key(a)),Editor 收到该事件
  pte05,"paste-through-listeners",listener 对 Paste 返回 Continue,调用 dispatch_event(Paste(...)),焦点组件收到 paste
